# 00. Repo Conditioning & Agentic Development Guide

**Document type:** Working setup contract (not a design doc)
**Project:** {{PROJECT_NAME}}
**Status:** Active
**Purpose:** Turn this greenfield repo into a state where Claude (and any coding agent) can build the backend **autonomously, safely and verifiably**. Defines (A) the conditioning plan, (B) the local dev environment, (C) the agentic development techniques to apply, and (D) exactly what the agent needs from the human to work without supervision.

> Related: `CLAUDE.md` (operational summary), source docs in `docs/` (the system spec). This doc is *how we build*; the source docs are *what we build*.

